# EDDY_CALIBRATE_Z presses the contact switch on a homed machine, which runs
# probing moves through the plugin's own endstop object. An endstop that drives
# no stepper makes the homing module take the maximum of an empty set, which is
# a traceback rather than a message, so this case gates the stepper binding.
# The measurement that follows the presses refuses to start: a batch run has
# no hardware behind the eddy sensor, and that refusal is the failure this
# case requires.
CONFIG printer.cfg
DICTIONARY linuxprocess.dict
SHOULD_FAIL

G28
EDDY_CALIBRATE_Z T=0 DEBUG=1
